I am sitting on my bed and my phone is in my hand.
My health is not fine at all today.
I cannot go to the office.
I pick up my phone.
In this condition, it is very difficult to go to the office by bus.
I should take a day off today and stay at home.
I open my phone to message Rohan.
We work together in the office.
I type, "Hi Rohan, I am not coming to the office today."
"I have caught a bad cold and I also have pain in my throat."
"I am taking 'sick leave' today."
I send the message and close my eyes.
My eyes are also burning a little.
After two minutes, Rohan's message comes on the phone.
Rohan's reply is, "Oh no, take care of yourself, Maya."
"You should rest today."
"Do not worry about work, I will take care of it."
I write thank you to him and put the phone on the table.
Now I should get ready to go to the clinic.
